= Rosa Luxemburg

The party's leading theorist and the author of its programme. She holds that the revolution must be the work of the majority of the working class, and she has doubts about the Bolsheviks' methods even while she defends their revolution.

[? if year = 1919 and month <= 2 : She lost the vote on the election boycott at the founding congress, and has not stopped arguing since. ?]

- @persuade
- @against_putsch
- @root: Return to main

@persuade
title: Win the Argument
subtitle: Districts held by other currents move towards the Zentrale.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    if (Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] != Q.leading_faction) {
        Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] += 10;
    }
}
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
!}

Luxemburg writes every day and speaks most evenings. Her opponents in the districts read her, and some of them change their minds.

@against_putsch
title: Against Putschism
subtitle: Calms the most restless district. The Left Radicals are offended.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
var d = RG.target('militancy');
RG.district(d, {militancy: -15, repression: -5});
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction -= 6;
!}

Luxemburg goes to [+ sys_target_name +] herself. A revolution cannot be ordered from above, she tells the district meeting, and an uprising nobody else joins will be drowned in blood. The hall is quiet when she sits down.
